# AI Prompt Logging

At the start of every turn (before doing other work), append the latest user prompt to `AI_LOG.md` in the project root.

## Format

```markdown
---

```
<exact user prompt text>
```
```

## Rules

- Log the full user prompt text exactly as received (do not summarize).
- Append only; never delete or rewrite earlier entries (except when the user explicitly asks to edit the log).
- Do this once per user message, even if the turn involves multiple tool calls.
- If `AI_LOG.md` is missing, create it with a short header: `# AI Prompt Log`
